  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> such that sum of the squares of the roots of the quadratic equation, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math> has the least value is:"
  },
